<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P ASSIGNS AA TO AEGON NV'S Y10 BLN SAMURAI ISSUE.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P ASSIGNS AA TO AEGON NV'S Y10 BLN SAMURAI ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Thursday it had assigned its AA rating to Aegon NV's 10 billion yen of three percent yen/dollar dual-currency bonds series two due on May 15, 2001.</p>
<p>The outlook of the rating is stable, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
